    <!-- Per-line loop HCFA -->
    <mxCell id="G4" value="PER-LINE LOOP  p = 5, 7, 9, 11&#xa;(skip if line empty)&#xa;&#xa;• faie_adj_inel: 908→new FAIE code&#xa;• rem_disc_amt_flag (Y / Y-DONT READ OITYPE)&#xa;• del_bn: remove BN r(p+l) c31/36&#xa;• inel_switch: 908→INEL_SWITCH_VAL r14c14&#xa;• bond_clinic: _apply_bond_clinic()&#xa;• flip_mod: _switch_mod() (swap P3/P4/P5)&#xa;• apply_001 (1 ONLY / ALL LINES / N/A guard)&#xa;• 2nd_inel_001: place NEW_INEL_CD slot 2&#xa;• remove_inel_amt_cd (CD1/CD2/ALL/SPECIFIC)&#xa;• deny_clm + dis_aft_dnl discount logic&#xa;• aply_dnl_aft_medcr: OI→denial slot&#xa;• remove_ap: clear AP code&#xa;• rem_code_set: clear code set&#xa;• chnge_dx_cd: place DX_CD r(p+1)c70&#xa;• apply_bn_qty: place BN_CODE/BN_QTY&#xa;• aply_two_ap_cd (1st): place AP_CD_1ST&#xa;• aply_modifr / apply_lab / apply_dx AP code&#xa;• remv_prov_rate: clear prov rate rows 14-17&#xa;• remv_modifr: clear matching modifiers&#xa;• dx_lab_rev: rev+dx match → # AP code&#xa;• _apply_new_oi_elig_pd() (ALL/1ST-4TH LINE)&#xa;• _apply_new_oi_indicator() (ALL/1ST-4TH LINE)&#xa;• aply_grid_prc: charge &gt; grid_price → 997 inel&#xa;• dny_s9451: S9451 CPT → 947 inel code&#xa;• id_hcr: possible_hcr CPT + bad inel → return 0&#xa;• rem_tu: clear time units&#xa;• add_time: add TIME_UNITS to existing" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#ffe0b2;strokeColor=#e65100;fontSize=9;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="460" y="1308" width="340" height="490" as="geometry"/>
